cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ensemble-da: model-independent ensemble Kalman filter and smoother analysis"
abstract: >-
  Python package for the analysis step of ensemble data assimilation: an ensemble Kalman
  filter and smoother with distance-based covariance localization, solved in observation space.
  It takes a forecast ensemble, observations, an observation operator and observation errors,
  and returns the analysis ensemble; forecast models are coupled through a function interface.
